<content><![CDATA[<p>Block out a small playable space with simple primitives to test scale, layout and sightlines before any detailed modeling.</p>
<h2>Learning Objectives</h2>
<ol>
<li>Establish player scale and metrics for a space</li>
<li>Lay out a space for navigation and focal points</li>
<li>Iterate on a greybox before committing to detail</li>
</ol>
